'' docs/tiko-properties D8, RUN: '&=' AND '+=' ON A USTRING PROPERTY. The narrow string was fixed and
'' the ustring declined: each statement was TKO0994. A type's auto-property, a chain reading the
'' property itself, an indexed property (index evaluated by the get and by the set: 2 calls), a static
'' one, a namespace's, a ustring and a narrow value appended. tiko-only, checked by hand.
